<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Site Audit MVP</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-100 antialiased">
    <main class="mx-auto flex min-h-screen w-full max-w-5xl flex-col justify-center px-5 py-10 sm:px-8">
        <section class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px] lg:items-center">
            <div>
                <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cyan-300">SEO • Security • Performance</p>
                <h1 class="max-w-3xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">
                    Глубокий экспресс-аудит сайта
                </h1>
                <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-zinc-300">
                    Проверяет индексацию, мета-теги, ссылки, медиа, security headers, скорость, доступность и базовую техническую гигиену страницы.
                </p>
            </div>

            <form action="/audit" method="POST" class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-5 shadow-2xl shadow-cyan-950/20">
                <label for="url" class="block text-sm font-medium text-zinc-200">URL сайта</label>
                <input
                    id="url"
                    type="url"
                    name="url"
                    value="<%= url %>"
                    placeholder="https://example.com"
                    required
                    class="mt-2 block w-full rounded-md border border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-950 px-4 py-3 text-base text-white outline-none transition focus:border-cyan-400 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-400/30"
                >

                <% if (error) { %>
                    <div class="mt-4 rounded-md border border-red-500/30 bg-red-500/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-red-200">
                        <%= error %>
                    </div>
                <% } %>

                <button type="submit" class="mt-5 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-cyan-400 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-950 transition hover:bg-cyan-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-300 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-zinc-950">
                    Запустить проверки
                </button>
            </form>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
